{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1533,
  "batch_count": 1682,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "f1c6893d60a8989361cfd9c371f56bc8ec25f81d",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf5858f24a72a344919e2cda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "愚かね。漫然と競えばよいとでも？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dac6056fc7bd1c46957a6e1b1c3d5c6ef47ae22c30fa83cbcabf18d3d0dd12ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1a04ce60e780e9fa2e9d9d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勝利は必然――貴方はどうぞ、\r\n喝采の準備でもなさいませ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aafef02d75fef40e247a769ccea716a3e946e114cee46beba2f07082e6da67f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43ee12ff2b3fd4e5b1bf0682",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最強の走り、ご覧に入れますわ。\r\n本日ここで、必ずや。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc6c4d04e0588ce4d9d2a710d81e48c6aa82a7a30f87684a413da67292385497",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f53c668d979adfabe3537da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ここは通過点ですわ。\r\n貴方も、この先を見据えなさい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7397b37c8a80a35d49b022c61caba738d57ac589cea5dae2d184ad7a3be91889",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5605e679d5b22129b76f64b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最も強い者が誰か。\r\nようやく皆様にお教えできるのね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a32791312956878444cdbf4510b33fe52d450d5052578d8a8fb6e5dc39826024",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5b74822e433b777e49c1d7a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私は強さを証明するだけ。\r\n結果は、自ずと見えるでしょう？",
      "source_fingerprint": "16e2ea65c29e0efd96095ec9baa315db992c74856c049825c438533d312d24e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f10771a35cc35b9a2a61735d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "時間ね。\r\nレースも観客も、\r\n『勝者』を待っていてよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05f3f62887c5ca05cf16feb69504af686cd46d80fbaa92fb1b4f7a979ebda02f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d5f062a2b83dd3c4b3e7058",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "興味深い方々が揃ったわね。\r\n今日は本気が出せるかしら？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe4e93ea5c4ce363231f1ff20a4db5219c753bce3b57888984460bd7421b6242",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:facb00b947f4f46bd10de5a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただ走るだけで圧倒する。\r\n強者の姿をお見せするわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d22a1c5898d3a35100d2025c06be8ffe0a79d0c6bedf1bb2ceb7abf92479c94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:728fe5110323f5c8d35237e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いつもと同じですわ。\r\n私はただ、示すのみ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a27d3314c1240840199f6eb12e4c0c8c4a9643e2fab2f891dbfa7de75256b767",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9e1ea27649723ab8a0c09ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "調子でしたら、お気になさらず。\r\nさ、まいりましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0602d87854d89562a87652687a9c579fe259597c7ebebf078e86d0eca0a9b5ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bef085ad53b450300493edd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多少の浮き沈みなど、\r\n埃が舞った程度のこと。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd953e3d16dd50f18105453019b46ca90bf3ce0fb03b841069e333eafedb5a8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ed02b6a7cc1cc37ca3a0564",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "未完の調整は、本番を走りながら\r\n仕上げるといたしましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f913116d8a448ff2723058ecea3aea1b652b05358769e84fa559e1d9072754d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4157f1e628b26699ca388933",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "深き闇の中でこそ、\r\n輝きは増すものでしょう？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0178d24c653e8eafe9913d77a1822ceb7aad7d999a595f032992f966d973b6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5e5163c20a939dedb47dec7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "調整不足？ほほほ…\r\n実に、些末な問題ですわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03a04b5ac57766d28370fb2d30fb452b68def415b18f83fdab253f8dbe4d744b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29f77e565d8d0d4f498f792f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この状態でようやく、\r\n歯応えが生まれるというもの。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0474a7394bf3991e1e4fc7ca966cbf7efb251ae9b28bdcd945dc013434f19521",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83d4d83701a3846b37822a94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふん！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b7f9d10469966733c1d50e88fa9e5ed490dba22d1f353e227a1fbc8b5c8e9bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:418889f962094959e0d9216d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さて。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ccc0a4c1d8553a1216b70a22cc2817117c30e5db50980ed67df860ae5ad58f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b9c0aabd6fbcc940f44a305",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よろしい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f61f2fb40e2660902b4fdecb54a607694cc2ff60520306ac36ae439fa4b91812",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd45ce4f50b1a1cb035fbce5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふぅん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29a2ebac998d486e987e560d4ef7afb4b5d819b9e56ff29e503e33bc53c8ed76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a957b4b557d97206971ca774",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あら？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca3d96c3410a5e8533f100ad345d4f90c0cc63cf32138c8ba71bb9a0f1f3db10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de26c8d0e339765a3f05bdaf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "はぁ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c8314545e95415cbadeb18610f29c1e28d72193a66a67e8c50153c22f50af68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c333d88d5aa9f89594c191a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "では。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbe6c54643b911ebcd5b717155dccc8184a709e95b8977732a8454b8049515dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3048f1e249f7e845ddb7a117",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふふっ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbc78ca5d65302a8b38bec657661270c58ae9fac943c1c718a7fa71c2d75ec30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b21918aa7b1cbe6120b978a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "貴方の手腕、悪くなかったわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bbfe4595a3397f9835d0139ef34d4288e3b770a3a34ad6d8db423990c97f829",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e5d2fbd0909774fb1bb8452",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感謝いたしますわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "754da2127865554214eeabb3d5c2d91765ab65c01d8184ee4cbb5bc5ecdf3137",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce9698efc8583b9a43e88c76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全力をぶつけ合いましょう？",
      "source_fingerprint": "362dc6a8d3bc39731ff4234e164708fd64046b9064388e08de5108d5fc167307",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3075b2e9739edb1974f9f57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "まいりましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7649606ba64bd115f061bcad811531899eef88e8676bafd30764edc12fa46186",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dce63450c9579c29d29ef3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目指すは勝利のみでしてよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b657d29bc169e294c2186bbbb8f50922fbebbfd1115a6c4574e2401676c88d62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d597f51556cd185318cef621",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感謝いたしますわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "754da2127865554214eeabb3d5c2d91765ab65c01d8184ee4cbb5bc5ecdf3137",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2bca68d916208a9da697a31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "時間ね。\r\nレースも観客も、\r\n『勝者』を待っていてよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05f3f62887c5ca05cf16feb69504af686cd46d80fbaa92fb1b4f7a979ebda02f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d358cb51f5b7216ca30cc487",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ここは通過点ですわ。\r\n貴方も、この先を見据えなさい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7397b37c8a80a35d49b022c61caba738d57ac589cea5dae2d184ad7a3be91889",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1121d3323a3fa7a6d497aa34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感謝いたしますわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "754da2127865554214eeabb3d5c2d91765ab65c01d8184ee4cbb5bc5ecdf3137",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b4c6630c59505af8e50a8b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さて。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ccc0a4c1d8553a1216b70a22cc2817117c30e5db50980ed67df860ae5ad58f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4015ee7cd95d06cb01625c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勝利以外は無価値。次よ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "663720c2cdcfe03a55d08b2507da9497d028f70bf4e4bf7058a179e6bfd74f8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e58824fb0f21b1d2deffb3fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あるべき姿を、必ず取り戻さねば。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5d13732bf6cb4733945fb843b08b9a58393ed1f1c5f5929f9eafa2d3f3ad59e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a364dcb8988f224a8bd9d320",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーニングの準備をなさい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0fb7d97b23d5122edb6bc834a2ca4600f0245b99be7a03f8a03f1ca71757272",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:429ab609dc298a1519bfd312",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…許されませんわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb2e791f6f2166994f48cfded79d2baa1acd99560919d77e39c6cff53c0f763d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c5ddc4ea0fbac80f70d9e61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私こそ勝者、私こそ最強。\r\nよろしくて？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2d9bc1b6a39f20ffbbda6276daf29007502c101a6e3127a3a59cf81d9e03676",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d5c8139132fb915f5853e7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "強さとは、かくあるべき――でしょう？",
      "source_fingerprint": "935bbb0febf5a521ca37a8ae2f5b5845fbbd29625cbb8d004137c094580e7ad0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9083f47fd4b3996a96124d0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "楽しめそうね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b72e69d9261b8dac1db8688f919661a430cb4d8f934fd9187a25f3898cb0ed7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:003f94974e517d96cc2b2ad3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ごめんあそばせ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bae8612b0fb845476733fa684c815a98d221f4b49c8d60d0e4b7c45f70e4b21",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:216e8a6c36ad511413ec4f9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "強さとは即ち、私そのもの。\r\n何者も届かない絶対の力。\r\nさあ、蹂躙の時間ですわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a03299f797bc0aee320b0f2f0e12d3f6c0eeac97e37c32aec348d5b8b9f578ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7727d4621ad4c6e9f63df1c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これも強者の務め。\r\n完璧に果たしますわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5284642358b5e5238d8af36098d066a0bfcc2853e1d05db9257a07c46fc9a073",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bbffc58ab364580886909ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "振り付けの確認など不要ですわ。\r\n早くまいりましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "779daa486b1dff5d240cfe2fb3d8fefcde308cb7734ad3252235844fc9c591ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a248d7bb6d862a0190400971",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『勝者たれ』、私のモットーですわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdeb9bef870ac3e85e8b33c34bfd5e5e1116365874cd4814afe222d1e6245948",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:772ed249b5f52861f7b07d00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ようこそいらっしゃいませ。\r\n勝者の道へ。そして、強者の頂へ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9c70c37b8f29280fc7169235af85385cf1a591a7a60df36c97907614898e3f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
