    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd0fb97e197b8c9bd50c0adb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鍛錬に適すか、試しておきたいわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "edecff5ad5857a5bb454acb128b1155385843d8d69a9aedd50896f75f6551825",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fec59350522176d319ee2578",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ご苦労様",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0ac7cfec9a6a963eeb774d4e7e66f9448350dc88e78eae39687afddd4598908",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1b27c09ef507a8efdd0411e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ごきげんよう。\r\n今日のトレーニングメニュー、\r\n早速共有してくださるかしら。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db25d28c706623044db3f10f788a43308652fe9e5c5becea4115d461f454fd6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6b442388eb10b4b85f0e164",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "善き1日は、朝に成すものよ。\r\nもう僅か、お召し物の\r\nシワを整えなさいませ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0a881f27ba26fe6093b6b878aa8ea95091253c9036a88402aaf7845e46e617a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6d1b0e9c995a51d3eeb7c72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーニングに向けて、\r\n皆さん発奮なさって。ふふ、私を\r\n脅かす日が来るのかしら…楽しみね",
      "source_fingerprint": "a27240e60ba53657e2d01d622a273b011a8a67738f753581f1d5ed9adb8367b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e004489d51f9f870d6cd054",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アフタヌーンティーはいかが？\r\n『SFTGFOP1』、\r\nお味は保証するわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e04dbe34b3053747a75218e28a54fb44862ce42b1b3fd1dbc98b8cd693e6dc8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ce83b30807ec727812fca45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜風を浴びに出かけようかしら。\r\n…あら、なあに？身の安全でも\r\n気遣ってくださるのかしら。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e3ffbe60a10ca85c0fa554989b3fe8576d8d3150b3c77aa27304ee06e2dcfed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48eb9e105e92b904ece4699d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "陽が落ちても、トレーニングに\r\n興じる生徒ばかり。くす、\r\n今後も愉しめそうで何よりですわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2769d0ba6410d0b6131c6a643a2982472796b5b10cc1e42463b5f5e5e8a006af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d4c7a8ce5b9ef4066eb13e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "綻びだした蕾をご覧になった？\r\n冬を耐え忍んだ強者たちよ――\r\n賞賛に値するわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a25246a5070c5cdcaa7a2604dff768f63ba095fd638305a917bef1f894f4a9ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bd6bd2124be8e32c14ec015",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鍛錬なら、日差しのもとへ。\r\n涼しげな場所では、\r\n熱も負荷も乏しいですわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d49c0684d44a63f28bdb915281788ec6d26fda1f07d07486ddec755dcc8d0627",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd4643caba457cc0a6ee622e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "滑らかな秋鮭のテリーヌ、\r\n美味でしたわ。季節が変わる前に、\r\nまたいただけるかしら。",
      "source_fingerprint": "127f39d984da5b7f06bf6f853cc05c80fc4383f3e61d8e5ca1207410ef8b926f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8b436113feaf805cea0f845",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "降り積もる雪をゆるりと\r\n眺めるつもりが、ついダンベルに\r\n手が伸びますのよ…ほほほ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c3647ff0d51b828107e563a5ce263e98e23eb4fc91612526d4bb9efbb6b9058",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b526b1b3d4066faaab1b7d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハッピーバレンタイン、ですわね",
      "source_fingerprint": "a66f35d6104bafc79e5b3f179f982b121a33fb639b31d08109ac44e8bdc5332c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e6c2d5092693c03d7d7e293",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ゴルシさんが考案された\r\n鉄アレイジャグリング。\r\n微塵も負荷が足りませんわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45dca813bb2b5cfc1e9185559544cc61056559e770cf5358d5aa202d389eeaee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bede86b2cd5a39be781ae16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说极峰小姐对说我坏话的人\r\n发火了。\r\n呵呵，真是位不会让人厌倦的人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "715d1e9344c72f3a5d77b5410e6cd27d91099c7661510c94acb18225467da19f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05bcc89b11bed815da808218",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ブエナさん、私の髪を梳きたいと\r\nいつも仰るの。ほほほ…\r\n甘え上手でかわいらしいこと。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1776ce7d877bde6bcddaac37e8669a7b07642dd17a795f0104e11976d67923e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99b865f80d901fc3d431c431",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "オルフェさんと帰り際にばったり。\r\n会話もしていないのに、周りが\r\n固唾を呑むのよ…ああ、おかしい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cf9dd1d6bcccccd0da8fc903b5875aa91df1698108d8614fb2a696a61807b38",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cd260f7e461fd487d80fe01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "戯れに、彫刻を手がけることも\r\nありますのよ。熊に獅子――\r\nそうそう、竜なども少々。",
      "source_fingerprint": "730a27a78e9a9806f605599821b3db6682097b825bff902beb54433d703e0765",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "91004"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
